 alone is probably Athletico-PR). And \"Vasco\", \"São Paulo\". Country suffixes: \"-EQU\", \"-PAR\", \"-URU\", \"(PER)\", \"(VEN)\" etc.\n\nNow let me check the historical file's unique team names and FIFA Brazilian clubs list, then check the Copa do Brasil rounds structure for finals detection. Then I'll design.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05d9376ce001xU1kui3hdjmM01","sessionID":"ses_fa26ff80dffeDQKLW66czjBP2c","messageID":"msg_05d935ac9001OcIQdazp1n05FP"}}
