 Brasil total = 1570** — cup file 2012-2021 (1337) + brf 2022-2023 (117+116=233) = 1570 ✓ correct.\n\n3. Libertadores total 1255 ✓.\n\n4. Palmeiras 2019: 74 pts, 21W-11D-6L ✓ matches reality ✓.\n\n5. Grêmio FIFA squad top players look like obscure players (Josué Chiamulera etc.) — that's actually correct for FIFA 19's Brazilian league squads (low-profile players in the game database; Grêmio's star players like Everton/Luan might be absent due to licensing... whatever, data is data).\n\nLet me debug the Corinthians 2022 home count.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05da6c657001jWOCJyXI555ofs","sessionID":"ses_fa26ff80dffeDQKLW66czjBP2c","messageID":"msg_05da6490a001Syxv7Y71LEUgjT"}}
