orwards at 'Grêmio': count? Let me check: Grêmio forwards in FIFA... I'll compute. Or position='ST' + nationality='Brazil' → count? compute in test with loose >0 and verify all positions in forwards set... let me get a concrete: forwards from Santos (FIFA club 'Santos'): Rodrygo? FIFA 19 Santos squad has Rodrygo (ST, 79?). Let me just compute club='Santos', position_group='forwards' count and assert set membership.\n- Gabriel Barbosa → 0 matches + note + similar_players non-empty (includes Gabriel Jesus)\n- Gabriel Jesus → overall 83, potential 92, club Manchester City\n- sort by potential: first for Brazil? compute: top potential Brazilian = Neymar Jr 93? check.\n- jersey/height fields present.\n\n**Competition queries (test_competition_queries.py):**\n- standings 2019: champion Flamengo, 90 pts, 28W-6D-4L, GF 86; relegated set {Cruzeiro, Chapecoense, CSA, Avaí}; Palmeiras row 74 pts position 2\n- standings 2020: champion Flamengo, relegated set {Vasco, Goiás, Coritiba, Botafogo}\n- get_relegation 2019 == bottom 4 of table\n- standings 2023 has data_note about incomplete\n- find_finals Libertadores 2018: 2 legs, winner River Plate\n- find_finals Libertadores all: 2019 winner Flamengo; includes season None entry with note (2022 final without recorded score)\n- find_finals Copa do Brasil 2020: 2 legs winner Palmeiras; 2015 winner None with tie note; 2021 note truncated\n- find_finals Serie A → note about league\n- standings for Copa do Brasil → TeamResolutionError (knockout)\n- competitions_overview: 5 competitions, Serie A total 8403, teams 423, players 18207\n\n**Statistics (test_statistics.py):**\n- competition_stats Serie A: matches 8321, avg 2.57, home_win_rate 49.7, biggest_win present\n- competition_stats with season: 2019 Serie A → 380 matches; avg goals ~2.53? compute exact in test via formula? assert 2 < avg < 3.\n- biggest_wins Libertadores: first = River Plate 8-0 Jorge Wilstermann 2017, margin 8\n- derby_matches Gre-Nal 2019 → 2 matches; derby sweep 2023